    <string name="help_text">How it works: the watchdog runs as a foreground service. Whenever the open network with the SSID above is in range and the phone is not connected to it, the app re-joins it and keeps Wi-Fi alive even if Android thinks it has no internet. Grant location (needed by Android to scan Wi-Fi), keep Location turned on, and exclude the app from battery optimisation so it survives in the background.</string>
